{"id": "zh-789fa932-0009", "text": "直接把这个接口标记为废弃就行,反正我们自己不用了。不过,老版手机客户端还在调它,强制升级不现实。应该保留并加废弃头。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 25, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "clausal-adversative", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 58, "topic_id": "p11-zh-legacy-api", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
