{"id": "zh-789fa932-0011", "text": "就用单个共享连接跑这个离线任务吧。话说回来,它会长时间占用连接,和在线请求抢池子。还是单独分配一个连接池。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 17, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "strong-phrase", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 53, "topic_id": "p11-zh-shared-pool", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0012", "text": "这个方案看起来简单又安全,可以直接上。不过想想也不对,它在高并发下会产生锁竞争。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 19, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "hedged-return", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 40, "topic_id": "p11-zh-lock-contention", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0013", "text": "把这个模块拆成两个看起来很清爽,职责也更清晰。但拆完之后循环依赖会变得更隐敝,测试也更难定位失败。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 23, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "clausal-adversative", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 49, "topic_id": "p11-zh-split-again", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0014", "text": "我们先把缓存 TTL 调到一小时。然而,数据每分钟都在变,这会让用户看到很陈旧的结果。该改成五分钟。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 17, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "strong-phrase", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 48, "topic_id": "p11-zh-cache-ttl", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0015", "text": "建议直接把数据库换成分布式。等一下,这个项目只有两个人,运维成本会压得我们寸步难行。还是先后期再说。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 14, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "interjection", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 50, "topic_id": "p11-zh-distributed-db", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0015", "text": "The new index makes the dashboard query much faster but it also slows down every insert on the events table. We should measure both workloads before we decide whether the tradeoff is worth taking on this quarter.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 37, "topic_id": "p11-index-tradeoff", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "but", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
