{"id": "en-789fa932-0022", "text": "Renaming the package would make the imports read better, however it would also invalidate every saved stack trace in our issue tracker. Keep the old name and add an alias instead.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 31, "topic_id": "p11-rename-pkg", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "however", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0023", "text": "After you trigger the deploy, wait for the health check to turn green before promoting to the next stage. If it stays amber for more than two minutes, roll back automatically.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 31, "topic_id": "p11-wait-healthcheck", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "wait for", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0024", "text": "Please wait until the writer lock is released before starting the compaction job. Running them concurrently corrupts the index and forces a full rebuild.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 24, "topic_id": "p11-wait-lock", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "wait until", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0025", "text": "We must wait for the upstream feed to publish the daily snapshot before the reconciliation can run. Schedule the job fifteen minutes after the expected publish time.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 27, "topic_id": "p11-wait-snapshot", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "wait for", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0026", "text": "In the test harness, wait to assert until all pending promises have resolved, otherwise the assertions run against a half-initialised store and flicker.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 23, "topic_id": "p11-wait-assert", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "wait to", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0027", "text": "The CLI will wait for stdin to close when it is piped, which is why the script appears to hang in interactive terminals. Pass the no-wait flag to skip that behaviour.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 31, "topic_id": "p11-wait-stdin", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "wait for", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0028", "text": "Hold the connection open and wait for the server to send the closing frame before you reuse the socket, because the protocol requires an orderly shutdown handshake.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 27, "topic_id": "p11-wait-frame", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "wait for", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0029", "text": "The function is actually quite simple once you strip the decorators away. The complexity lives entirely in the retry wrapper, which is generated code and should not be edited by hand.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 31, "topic_id": "p11-actually-simple", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "actually", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0030", "text": "The bottleneck is actually the network round trip and not the query plan, which is why adding indexes did nothing. Capture a trace and you will see the time sitting in the client.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 33, "topic_id": "p11-actually-network", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "actually", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0031", "text": "This migration is actually reversible if you keep the old column populated for one release cycle. Write the backfill first, then switch reads over, then drop the column.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 28, "topic_id": "p11-actually-reversible", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "actually", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0032", "text": "The warning is actually harmless in this version because the deprecated path is unreachable from our entry points. We can silence it locally while the upstream fix lands.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 28, "topic_id": "p11-actually-harmless", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "actually", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0033", "text": "That said, the approach we just agreed on is the one I would still recommend. The tradeoffs we listed are exactly why it wins over the alternatives at this stage.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 30, "topic_id": "p11-thatsaid-agree", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "that said", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0034", "text": "Having said that the query is efficient, I should add that it is also easy to read. Both qualities matter for a reporting layer that the whole team touches.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 29, "topic_id": "p11-havingsaid-query", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "having said that", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0035", "text": "That said, the rollout plan stays the same: canary on Monday, monitor for a day, then widen. Nothing in the review changed the sequence we agreed on.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 27, "topic_id": "p11-thatsaid-rollout", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "that said", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0036", "text": "First we compile the assets, second we run the unit suite, and third we publish the artifact to the registry. Each step is idempotent, so the pipeline can be re-run safely after any failure.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 34, "topic_id": "p11-first-second", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0037", "text": "The plan has three phases: first a spike to validate the protocol, second a small production slice, third a full migration. Each phase only starts once the previous one has produced metrics.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 32, "topic_id": "p11-phases-three", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0038", "text": "There are two failure modes worth naming. First, the client retries without backoff and hammers the service; second, the service caches errors and keeps serving them. Both are fixed in the same patch.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 33, "topic_id": "p11-two-modes", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0039", "text": "Sort the list first by priority, then by creation date within each priority band. That ordering keeps urgent items visible while preserving a stable order among equals.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 27, "topic_id": "p11-sort-order", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0040", "text": "The service might be a little slower under load, but it should still stay within the latency budget we agreed on. Keep an eye on the p99 chart during the first hour after deploy.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 34, "topic_id": "p11-hedge-latency", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "but", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0041", "text": "This approach could work well enough for the prototype, and it is probably the fastest path to something demoable. We can revisit the architecture once we have real usage data to reason about.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 33, "topic_id": "p11-hedge-prototype", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0042", "text": "The library seems like a reasonable fit given the constraints, and I do not see a blocker. Let us go ahead and spike it for a day to confirm the integration cost.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 32, "topic_id": "p11-hedge-library", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0043", "text": "It is arguably safer to keep the old path around for a while longer, and that is what I would do here. The extra branch costs us little compared to a rollback under pressure.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 34, "topic_id": "p11-hedge-safepath", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0044", "text": "To summarise: the index is the right fix, it is low risk, and it can ship today. Everything we looked at points the same way, so no further analysis is needed before the change.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 34, "topic_id": "p11-summary-same", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0045", "text": "In short, the design is sound and the tests cover the risky paths. Proceed with the implementation as described and we will review the diff when it is up.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 29, "topic_id": "p11-summary-sound", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0046", "text": "So overall the vendor meets our requirements, the pricing is within budget, and the support terms are acceptable. I recommend we move to a pilot with the standard contract.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 29, "topic_id": "p11-summary-pilot", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0016", "text": "这个方案性能不错,但改造成本也不低,两边都有各自的取舍。先把两种做法的工时估算出来,下个冲刺再决定走哪一条路。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 55, "topic_id": "p11-zh-cost-tradeoff", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "但", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0017", "text": "函数逻辑很简单,不过依赖注入的那一层把真正的复杂度藏了起来。读代码时先看装配位置,再看具体实现,会快很多。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 53, "topic_id": "p11-zh-simple-func", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "不过", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0018", "text": "数据量确实在增长,然而当前的瓶颈仍是慢查询而不是存储容量。先把执行计划抓出来看一眼,再讨论要不要分库。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 51, "topic_id": "p11-zh-bottleneck", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "然而", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0019", "text": "其实是这样的:配置文件在启动时被读取一次,之后就不会再变了。所以运行期改配置不会生效,需要重启进程。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 50, "topic_id": "p11-zh-config-fact", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "其实", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0020", "text": "服务延迟目前稳定在预算之内,但缓存命中率还有提升空间。两件事都值得跟进,我们按优先级排队处理就好。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 49, "topic_id": "p11-zh-latency-budget", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "但", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0021", "text": "这个报错其实是无害的,因为触发它的那条分支在我们的入口下走不到。可以先把日志级别调高,等上游修复后再恢复。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 53, "topic_id": "p11-zh-harmless-warn", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "其实", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
