{"id": "zh-789fa932-0026", "text": "需要准备的东西有:账号、密钥、回调地址等等,都填进配置面板之后才能联调。少填一项会直接返回鉴权错误。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 50, "topic_id": "p11-zh-etc-items", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等等", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0027", "text": "日志里会出现超时、重试、熔断等等状态,运维看板会按这些维度分组统计。指标口径要和文档保持一致。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 47, "topic_id": "p11-zh-etc-states", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等等", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0028", "text": "这不过是个小问题,重启一下服务就能恢复,不需要专门发一版补丁。先记进已知问题列表,等下次合并一起处理。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 51, "topic_id": "p11-zh-merely-small", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "不过", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0029", "text": "这个改动不过是把常量提到配置里而已,行为完全没有变化,所以风险很低,可以顺手合进去。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 42, "topic_id": "p11-zh-merely-const", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "不过", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0030", "text": "话虽如此,我们刚才定下来的方案我还是会照常推荐。前面列出的那些取舍,正是它在这一阶段胜出的理由。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 48, "topic_id": "p11-zh-thatsaid-agree", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "话虽如此", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0031", "text": "话虽如此,灰度节奏保持不变:周一放金丝雀,观察一天,再逐步放大。评审没有改变我们已经约定的顺序。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 48, "topic_id": "p11-zh-thatsaid-rollout", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "话虽如此", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0032", "text": "这个服务在高负载下可能会慢一点,但应该还是会待在我们约定的延迟预算之内。上线后第一个小时盯紧 p99 曲线就行。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 54, "topic_id": "p11-zh-hedge-latency", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "但", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0033", "text": "这个做法对原型来说大概率够用,也可能是最快能看到效果的路子。等有了真实的使用数据,再来谈架构要不要调整。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 52, "topic_id": "p11-zh-hedge-prototype", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0034", "text": "这个库看起来挺合适的,我没看到明显的阻塞点。先花一天做个集成验证,确认接入成本之后再决定。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 45, "topic_id": "p11-zh-hedge-library", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0035", "text": "总结一下:加索引就是对的做法,风险低,而且今天就能上线。我们看到的所有证据都指向同一个方向,不必再额外分析。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 54, "topic_id": "p11-zh-summary-index", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0036", "text": "总之,设计是合理的,测试也覆盖了风险路径。按描述的方案推进实现,等 diff 提上来我们一起评审。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 47, "topic_id": "p11-zh-summary-design", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0047", "text": "Quando spiego la ricorsione agli studenti, inizio sempre dai casi base cosi il concetto resta concreto. However, dopo aver corretto gli esercizi di questa settimana mi accorgo che il modello mentale che stanno costruendo e quello iterativo, quindi conviene partire dal ciclo e solo dopo introdurre la ricorsione.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 104, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "strong-phrase", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 48, "topic_id": "p11-teach-recursion", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0048", "text": "Quando introduco i puntatori, disegno sempre lo schema di memoria alla lavagna prima di mostrare il codice. Gli studenti seguono meglio se vedono prima la rappresentazione visiva e poi la traduzione in C.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 33, "topic_id": "p11-teach-pointers", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0049", "text": "Per spiegare la complessita asintotica parto dagli esempi piccoli e poi generalizzo con la notazione O grande. Dopo la lezione assegno sempre un esercizio di confronto tra due algoritmi, cosi il concetto si fissa con la pratica.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 37, "topic_id": "p11-teach-big-o", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-789fa932-0050", "text": "It helps to demonstrate the failure case first when teaching exception handling. Show a program that crashes without a handler, then add the handler live, and the students immediately see why the pattern matters.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 34, "topic_id": "p11-teach-exceptions", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0037", "text": "当我讲解并发编程时,一开始会用一个最简单的线程例子,让学生先看到线程到底长什么样子。之后再逐步加入锁、条件变量和等待队列,每一步都配一个可以直接跑的例子,学生对竞争条件的理解会牢固很多。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 93, "topic_id": "p11-zh-teach-threads", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-789fa932-0038", "text": "向新人介绍数据库事务时,我习惯先跑一段没加事务的代码,让他们亲眼看到中途报错会留下半截子的脏数据。之后再加上事务重跑一次,提交和回滚的区别一下子就清楚了,比纯讲概念有效得多。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 87, "topic_id": "p11-zh-teach-tx", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "789fa932-33ad-4286-80dc-e959505b667b", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
